    "created_at": "2016-10-28T14:34:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-28T14:34:22Z",
    "body": "Just an opinion...\n\nWhy can't we have an algorithm similar to normal in case of `reverse`\n- If reversed, \n  -   start from last tag \n  -   if value is present, set the value to the defined value and start reducing, while navigating backwards.\n\n``` html\n<ol reversed>\n   <li> x </li>\n   <li value = 5 > x </li>\n   <li> x </li>\n   <li> x </li>\n</ol>\n```\n\n4,5,2,1\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
